l and plummeting space junk. This is truly SimCity without limits!\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Re-create cities from around the globe with hundreds of new buildings.\r\n- Reunify East and West Berlin in one of 13 scenarios.\r\n- Spruce up your city with over 95 world landmarks.\r\n- Protect your citizens from 4 new disasters.\r\n- Select hundreds of buildings from SimCity 3000 and all-new Asian and European buildings.\r\n- Create unique masterpieces for your metropolis with the Building Architect Plus tool.\r\n- Inflict 9 disasters, including toxic clouds, plague of locusts, space junk, and a whirlpool.\r\n- Play 13 challenging scenarios, or make your own with the SimCity Scenario Creator.\r\n\r\n*Conditions and restrictions apply. See www.ea.com/legal for details. ","ProductTitle":"Sim City 3000™ Unlimited","ShortTitle":"Sim City 3000™ Unlimited","SortTitle":"Sim City 3000™ Unlimited","FriendlyTitle":null,"ShortDescription":"","SearchTitles":[{"SearchTitleString":"Sim City","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Unlimited ","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Simulation","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Strategy","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"City Builder","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Singleplayer","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Casual","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"}],"VoiceTitle":"Sim City 3000™ Unlimited","RenderGroupDetails":null,"ProductDisplayRanks":[],"InteractiveModelConfig":null,"Interactive3DEnabled":false,"Language":"en","Markets":["US","DZ","AR","AU","AT","BH","BD","BE","BR","BG","CA","CL","CN","CO","CR","HR","CY","CZ","DK","EG","EE","FI","FR","DE","GR","GT","HK","HU","IS","IN","ID","IQ","IE","IL","IT","JP","JO","KZ","KE","KW","LV","LB","LI","LT","LU","MY","MT","MR","MX","MA","NL","NZ","NG","NO","OM","PK","PE","PH","PL","PT","QA","RO","RU","SA","RS","SG","SK","SI","ZA","KR","ES","SE","CH","TW","TH","TT","TN","TR","UA","AE","GB","VN